  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Peter Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey Kevin, Peter Wilcox. I'm calling for my mother, her trash didn't get picked up again. That's two in a row now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:32:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two weeks running, okay. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:32:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "432 Old Beach Road, over by Easton's Beach. Sorry, I'm bouncing around here, my baby's teething and the only thing that works is walking and bouncing, so if I sound like I'm on a boat, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Got it, 432 Old Beach Road, missed pickup two weeks in a row. Was the barrel out at the curb by the usual time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:32:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Out the night before, both times. Also, while I have you, she's got an old washing machine in the garage. How do I get that hauled off? Does it go out with the regular trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually appliances don't go in with the regular pickup. There's typically a separate bulky item arrangement. I'll put in the missed pickup now and have the bulky item folks call you about the washer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:33:23-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Best number is 401-555-0150."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:33:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one five zero, got it. Somebody will get back to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T09:33:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Appreciate it, Kevin. Okay, buddy, shh, almost done. Thanks."
    }
  ],
